    "body": "Added config for [tsrs](https://github.com/oxc-project/tsrs), a Rust implementation of TypeScript 7 language server.\n`tsrs --lsp -stdio` speaks the same protocol as `tsgo --lsp -stdio`, so most of the settings have been ported from tsgo. This setting does not conflict with the [officially recommended one](https://github.com/oxc-project/tsrs/blob/main/docs/LSP.md#editor-setup).",
